name: Vurminal
icon: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/vurminal/icon.svg
version: 1.5.2
creator: Mohtadi Azad Mahi
description: Connects Sugarcane to the Vurminal Receiver through a WebRTC peer code. The receiver is a terminal-style remote controller; all editor commands execute locally in the add-on, with unlimited slash-command execution, live context, UI control access, and download mirroring.
